and bustle is almost unavoidable, and social connections are almost a must in order to get your day-to-day life going, one has to ensure the right first impression. And for that, finding the right Orthodontist for your perfect teeth is significant.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While a dentist is someone who would take care of your complete oral health, including teeth whitening, crowning, filling, etc.; an orthodontist solely specializes in fixing misaligned teeth using braces, palatal expanders, or now, Invisalign. So, what is Invisalign?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Invisalign:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign.jpg\" alt=\"invisalign\" class=\"wp-image-4043\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign.jpg 1000w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Invisalign is a brand of clear aligners that started manufacturing in the US and has benefited more than 14 million patients so far. Aligners are just your 3D digitally scanned aligners that are printed to treat any misaligned teeth. <\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">So far, even in the Indian market, Invisalign has been a big hit. It came in a market that required a big update to the regular braces which were a big inconvenience and had a huge room for improvement. How exactly is Invisalign better than braces?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Advantages of Invisalign:<\/h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign.jpg\" alt=\"advantages of invisalign\" class=\"wp-image-4044\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign.jpg 1000w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/advantages-of-invisalign-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Advantages of Invisalign<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Compared to braces, which are very on the face and visible, Invisalign is transparent and invisible. For people who feel conscious about wearing braces, Invisalign is a discreet and safe option.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Where braces are made of metal, Invisalign is made from soft plastic. This makes the whole aligning process a whole lot more comfortable.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Convenience is a big plus for Invisalign, as they can be easily removed while brushing, flossing, eating, etc.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>With the whole process of 3D mapping your teeth and printing accordingly, it is easier to assess how the end result is going to be.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>It is very customizable and fits perfectly and comfortably in your mouth while resting and aligning each and every tooth.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">When to See an Invisalign Orthodontist in Chennai?<\/h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1000\" height=\"667\" src=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-orthodontist-in-chennai.jpg\" alt=\"invisalign orthodontics in chennai\" class=\"wp-image-4045\" srcset=\"https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-orthodontist-in-chennai.jpg 1000w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-orthodontist-in-chennai-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/drdilipdentalcentre.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/02\/invisalign-orthodontist-in-chennai-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Invisalign Orthodontist in Chennai<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">While going to a dentist can be a routine thing for your regular check-ups, an orthodontist is usually an in-need business. Here are some of the most common requirements for people to book an appointment with their Orthodontists:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>If your teeth are crowded and are overlapping, an Orthodontist can help you fix them and straighten them to ensure they look good.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>If you have large gaps or uneven spaces between your teeth, a simple Invisalign routine can be the perfect solution.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>For many people, there is an issue of misaligned teeth when they close their mouth, an orthodontist can help you fix that.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Not just your teeth, if there is any pain in your jaws, or if you feel your jaws are misaligned, then an orthodontist can help you relieve the pain.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>For many babies, there are issues like early\/late loss of baby teeth, prolonged thumb sucking, and breathing through the mouth, that might require a trip to your orthodontist.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Without further ado, let\u2019s look at the detailed review of the <strong>5 best invisalign orthodontists in Chennai <\/strong>with contact details.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">List of 5 Best Invisalign Treatment Orthodontists in Chennai<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Find the list of 5 best Invisalign orthodontists for Invisalign treatment in Chennai at affordable cost. Invisalign discreetly straightens your teeth, keeping your treatment virtually unnoticed until